+# Invoice review
+
+Invoice review is a service that identifies invoice total discrepancies for an operator to review.
+
+## Current behavior
+
+- `reviewInvoice` compares a provided invoice total with an expected total.
+- It reports the numeric difference and whether operator review is required.
+
+## Boundary
+
+The service does not approve payment or change an invoice.
